    "title": "Who Is Stingray on ‘The Masked Singer’ Season 14? Clues, Guesses, & Spoilers Revealed!",
    "text": "The Masked Singer is back! A new episode of season 14 of the hit FOX singing competition series aired on Wednesday night (March 18). The show, which began in South Korea, features celebrities singing songs while wearing costumes and face masks concealing their identities until they’re eliminated. Throughout the season, the contestants provide clues to try and help the judges and fans figure out who is under the mask. This season’s contestants boast a combined total of 94 million records sold, 21 platinum singles, 3 Emmy Award victories, 3 Hall of Famers, 3 World Series wins, and 54 million Instagram followers. In honor of “Star Trek Night”, Stingray hit the stage for a performance of “Starboy” by The Weekend. Keep reading to see all of the clues and guesses…Keep scrolling to check out the clues and guesses… FIRST PERFORMANCE CLUES: - He’s a big partier and goes to a lot of events, openings, and premieres - Has been to the Met Gala - His mom used to host star-studded parties at the home, which Michael Jackson attended - Appears to be a nepo baby and a part of music royalty - Photo of Paris Hilton on display - Has lot of friends that have appeared on this show - Once climbed on the roof of the Chateau Marmont PANEL GUESSES: Lenny Kravitz, Jaden Smith, & Lil Romeo SECOND PERFORMANCE CLUES: - Angel statue shown - Appears to come from a famous family - His mother is the big star in the family - South and South West clocks shown - He’s wearing a wedding ring - He owns a sushi restaurant PANEL GUESSES: Jaden Smith, Patrick Schwarzenegger, & Donald Glover THIRD PERFORMANCE CLUES: - Basketball seen inside of fish tank - Witch’s hat on display - A tarantula nearly ruined his proposal to his wife - A cat is part of his clue package PANEL GUESSES: Jordan Fisher, Joey McIntyre, & Jason Derulo FOURTH PERFORMANCE CLUES: - He’s connected with someone else in the competition - He’s not Jason Derulo - Grew up around celebrities - Bedazzled glove - He’s connected to Michael Jackson PANEL GUESSES: Chris Tucker, Jordan Fisher, & Evan Ross OUR GUESS: Evan Ross Based on the clues, we’re pretty sure that Evan Ross is under the Stingray mask. In the clue package, he mentioned that he was often seen on Sunset Boulevard, and Evan once owned a home on the Sunset Strip. Evan and Paris Hilton have been friendly for years, and his mom Diana Ross, is a music legend that often hosted star-studded parties at her home. His ex-girlfriend Aubrey O’Day previously competed on the show as Ant in season 13. And last year, he attended the Met Gala with his mother. Evan is married to fellow singer Ashlee Simpson and he is a co-owner and investor in two restaurants – The Hideaway in Beverly Hills and Leona’s Sushi House in Studio City. Michael Jackson is Evan‘s godfather.",
